nge day).","C (average at origination): the same lookup on the origination date (for a variable loan, the last rate-change date, s.4(4)); if none was published, use the loan's own rate at origination (s.3(4)).","Fee s.3(3) applies only if A < the loan rate R today; fee s.3(4) applies only if C < the loan rate at origination; charge the lower of the two (s.3(5)).","Then cut 20% after 3 full years and 30% after 5 (complementary loans 10/20/30/40% after 1/2/3/4 years) (s.8).","No capitalization fee on loans whose rate changes yearly or more often or at unknown dates (prime), on a rate-change day, or on directed (state eligibility) loans (s.2, s.4)."],"latest":{"nl":{"in_force_from":"2026-10-19","data_month":"2026-09-30","avg":4.5459,"le1":4.3505,"1_5":4.5069,"5_10":4.5927,"10_15":4.6074,"15_20":4.739,"20_25":4.7878,"gt25":4.8886},"cpi":{"in_force_from":"2026-10-19","data_month":"2026-09-30","avg":3.491,"le5":3.501,"5_10":3.4871,"10_15":3.2417,"15_20":3.4552,"20_25":3.3652,"gt25":3.5272}},"counts":{"nl":163,"nl_pre2013":53,"cpi":183,"cpi_old":248},"order":{"law":"צו הבנקאות (פירעון מוקדם של הלוואה לדיור), התשס\"ב-2002, as amended 27.8.2014 (ק\"ת 7415)","text_sources":["https://he.wikisource.org/wiki/צו_הבנקאות_(פירעון_מוקדם_של_הלוואה_לדיור)","https://boi.org.il/media/qy5cow0l/116.pdf","https://www.nevo.co.il/law_html/Law01/047_037.htm"],"operational_fee_max_ils":60,"short_notice":{"min_notice_days":10,"fee_pct_of_repaid":0.1,"waived":["the same bank lends the money for the prepayment (on that amount)","borrower died"]},"notice_max_days_ahead":45,"unused_notice_lock_months":6,"cpi_fee":{"applies":"CPI-linked loan repaid on day 1 to 15 of a month","fee":"repaid amount x 0.5 x average monthly CPI change over the last 12 published indices"},"capitalization":{"s3_3":"if A (average today) < R (loan rate today): fee <= PV(A) - PV","s3_4":"if C (average at origination) < loan rate at origination: fee <= PV(A) - PV(C); if no average was published at origination, C = the loan's own rate then","charge":"lower of s3_3 and s3_4 when both exist (s.3(5))","pv_a":"sum_{i=1..n} B_i/(1+A)^i + [sum_{i=1..N-n} B_{i+n}/(1+R)^i]/(1+A)^n ; the bracket is the principal on the rate-change day; if N = n drop it","pv_c":"same with C in place of A","pv":"repaid principal plus linkage and accrued interest to the repayment day","rates_are_periodic":"A, C, R are periodic (monthly) rates; the published averages are effective annual, so monthly = (1+e/100)^(1/12) - 1","bucket":"remaining term to final repayment; variable loan: to the day before the next rate-change day (s.7(a))","offset":"if A > R the negative PV difference is offset against the other fees (s.7(b)); same for s.3(4) when C >= A (s.7(c))"},"no_capitalization_fee":["rate changes at unknown dates or at least once a year (prime, yearly variable) (s.4(2))","repayment on the rate-change day: operational fee only (s.4(3))","directed (state eligibility) loans: no fee at all (s.2)","enforcement on a single home of an individual: no prepayment fee unless the sale proceeds exceed 2.5M ILS (CPI-linked) or the full debt (Banking (Service to Customer) Law s.9A1)"],"reductions":{"regular":[{"from_years":3,"to_years":5,"cut_pct":20},{"from_years":5,"cut_pct":30}],"complementary_to_eligibility":[{"from_years":1,"cut_pct":10},{"from_years":2,"cut_pct":20},{"from_years":3,"cut_pct":30},{"from_years":4,"cut_pct":40}]},"partial":"shortening the term: fee on the payments brought forward or the pro rata share of a full-repayment fee; lower payment, same term: pro rata to the share repaid (second schedule, part C)","statements":"explanation sheet with the fees and amounts as far as known in advance when asking to prepay; itemized statement within 60 days after the prepayment (s.12)"}}